  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I be talkin' that fresh shit, I don't need gum (Nah)",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Cookie crumbs in the Rolls, never no weed crumbs (No)",
          "rhyme": "$b",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "He ain't talk to his bitch in three days",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It ain't gotta be this way, I'm down for the threesome (Woo)",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I might buy a boat (Nigga, yeah)",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Depends if Capri got space, don't really need one",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I can go in the wintertime, baby, I bleed sun",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Find another nigga like me 'cause I ain't seen one (Tell 'em, no)",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Pull up in that, uh, whatchamacallit? (Nyoom)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Played a couple demos at Madison Square Garden",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And tell them motherfuckers at Sony I'm not callin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I'm plottin' on a billi', chilly in my garden, yuh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGFCHIJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDAAEACFGE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "B-Hop, uh, French Waltz, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "She say she like the Royce and I'm like \"Which one?\"",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I got two, hun, look (Let's go)",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Catch me in my other-other-other-other crib, that's my AKA",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Hurricane-proof all the views, shit like \"A Bay Bay\" (Damn)",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "The fuzzy hat, ascot, passport got tattoos",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Slim nigga, big dick, with a fuckin' gap tooth",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "The way he beam (Bunny)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Call me Mr. Always On Some Shit You Never Seen (Hop)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "In that mansion, livin' single, bitch, I'm Maxine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "\"Niggas of your standard shouldn't talk\"",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Give a fuck about your thoughts, call me if you get lost, bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFFGHHIJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACDEEFFFBF"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Look, tried to take somebody bitch 'cause I'm a bad person",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I don't regret shit because that **** worth it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "In the end, she picked him, I hope when they fuckin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "She still thinkin' of me 'cause I'm that perfect",
          "rhyme": "Ekt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'ma get that deep text when this verse surface",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Better send it to my ego 'cause that shit hurtin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hope y'all shit workin' (True story), I'm a psycho, huh?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Don't give a fuck, you left my heart twerkin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Movin', losin', grip on my doings (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Eyes is cryin' on the jet cruisin' (Phew-phew-phew)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "'Bout to spend millions just to fill voids up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Drama, I need you (Yessir), can you turn the noise up?",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Can you turn the noise up? Can you turn the noise up? (Go, go, go, go)",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Turn the fuckin' noise up, ah, nigga, my heart broken",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Remembered I was rich, so I bought me some new emotions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And a new boat 'cause I'd rather cry in the ocean",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "It's T, baby, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGCFFHHHIJCG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDEFBEEGGGCHBF"
    },
    {
